\subsection{A schematic of superset-based early stopping}
Figure~\ref{fig:schematic} illustrates the idea behind ACSC-UB: at each prefix length $t$, compute the maximum possible final share for each label. Those that cannot reach $\tau$ even under best-case future votes are pruned. Once the remaining superset is small (e.g., one label), we stop and return it, preserving coverage.

